  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, combine smoked beef, onion, bell pepper, lime zest, oregano, garlic, red pepper flakes, salt, and black pepper.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together olive oil and parsley.",
    "Add the olive oil mixture to the beef mixture and toss to coat.",
    "Thread the beef mixture onto skewers.",
    "Grill the skewers for 8-10 minutes per side, or until the beef reaches 135°F (57°C) for medium-rare.",
    "Let the skewers rest for 5 minutes before serving.",
